# @alcspower/ui — Cursor Rules

## Component Architecture
- Pattern: `React.forwardRef` + `cva()` variants + `cn()` class merging
- Structure: `ComponentName.tsx`, `ComponentName.test.tsx`, `ComponentName.stories.tsx`, `index.ts`
- Naming: kebab-case directories, PascalCase files and exports
- Polymorphism: `asChild` prop with Radix `Slot` for element delegation

## Styling
- ONLY use `alcspower-*` semantic token classes
- NEVER use raw hex colors or static Tailwind utilities (bg-blue-600, text-gray-900)
- Use `cn()` from `src/lib/utils` for merging classes
- Shadows: `shadow-2xs`/`shadow-xs` resting, `shadow-xl`/`shadow-2xl` floating
- Radii: `rounded-lg` (sm), `rounded-xl` (md/lg), `rounded-full` (circular)
- Interactive: `active:scale-[0.98]` on clickable elements
- Focus: `focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-alcspower-primary/20`
- Disabled: `disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45`
- Motion: `motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:transform-none`

## Testing (Vitest + @testing-library/react + vitest-axe)
- Every component MUST pass `axe()` with zero violations
- Test rendering, variants, keyboard interaction, and accessibility
- Run: `pnpm typecheck && pnpm test && pnpm build`

## API Rules
- NEVER remove or rename an existing export
- Add optional props only (preserve backward compatibility)
- Use `@deprecated` JSDoc before eventual removal
- All exports flow through `src/index.ts` barrel

## Design Tokens
- Defined in `src/styles/tokens.css` as `--alcspower-*` CSS custom properties
- Light: `:root { }` | Dark: `.dark, [data-theme="dark"] { }`
- CSS layers: `@layer alcspower-tokens`, `@layer alcspower-ui`
